{"seq":67,"slug":"date-time-handling","title":"时间与日期处理","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"时间与日期处理\">时间与日期处理</h1><p>几乎每一个程序都要和时间打交道，而几乎每一个程序员都至少被时间坑过一次：一条本该今天到期的提醒在用户跨过时区后提前了一天触发；一段在测试机上跑得好好的限流逻辑在闰秒那一夜短暂失灵；一个用 32 位整数存储的过期时间，在 2038 年悄悄翻转成 1901 年。时间看似是最朴素的物理量，却是软件工程里最容易被低估的复杂领域之一。它的复杂不来自数学，而来自人类为了协调生产生活，给一条本应单调流逝的物理量层层叠加了历法、政治、天文与工程约定。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 用四章把这套约定层层拆开，顺序本身就是一条从底向上的依赖链。</p>\n<p>第一章「<a href=\"foundations/\">基础</a>」打地基。它先厘清三个常被混为一谈的概念——某个事件发生的「时刻」、两个时刻之间的「时长」、以及人读得懂的「挂钟时间」；再区分两类语义截然不同的时钟：能可靠测量流逝时间的单调时钟，与可能被回拨的挂钟时钟；最后讲清纪元与各种数值表示，把抽象的时间落成可以存进内存与磁盘的比特。</p>\n<p>第二章「<a href=\"calendars/\">历法与时区</a>」引入人类约定带来的第一层复杂性。时区与 UTC 偏移把同一时刻映射成数百种本地读数，夏令时让本地时间出现重复与跳空的「空洞」，而格里高利历之外的众多历法系统提醒我们「日期」本身就不是普适的。这一章解释了为什么「永远以 UTC 存储」是工程铁律。</p>\n<p>第三章「<a href=\"precision/\">精度与标准</a>」处理正确性的边界。闰秒揭示了原子时与天文时的撕扯及其 2035 年存废之争；2038 问题展示了表示位宽如何决定系统寿命；ISO 8601 与 RFC 3339 则给出了让机器之间无歧义交换时间的书写规范。</p>\n<p>第四章「<a href=\"distributed/\">分布式与实践</a>」收口到多机现实。当多台机器各有一只不完全可信的时钟，NTP 与 PTP 负责把它们尽量校准，逻辑时钟与混合逻辑时钟负责在无法完全校准时仍能为事件定序，而最后一篇把全 hub 的教训浓缩成一份可执行的工程实践清单。</p>\n<p>读完四章，你应当能在任何语言里写出经得起跨时区、跨夏令时、跨年份、跨机器考验的时间代码。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"time-concepts","title":"时间概念：时刻、时长与挂钟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/foundations/time-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"clocks-monotonic","title":"单调时钟与挂钟时钟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/foundations/clocks-monotonic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"epoch-representations","title":"纪元与时间表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/foundations/epoch-representations"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"calendars","title":"历法与时区","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/calendars","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"timezones-utc","title":"时区与 UTC 偏移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/calendars/timezones-utc"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dst-complexities","title":"夏令时的复杂性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/calendars/dst-complexities"},{"seq":3,"slug":"calendar-systems","title":"历法系统与本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/calendars/calendar-systems"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"precision","title":"精度与标准","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/precision","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"leap-seconds","title":"闰秒","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/precision/leap-seconds"},{"seq":2,"slug":"time-precision-overflow","title":"时间精度与溢出：2038 问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/precision/time-precision-overflow"},{"seq":3,"slug":"iso8601-rfc3339","title":"时间格式标准：ISO 8601 与 RFC 3339","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/precision/iso8601-rfc3339"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"distributed","title":"分布式与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/distributed","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clock-synchronization","title":"时钟同步：NTP 与 PTP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/distributed/clock-synchronization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-time","title":"分布式时间：逻辑、向量与混合时钟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/distributed/distributed-time"},{"seq":3,"slug":"datetime-best-practices","title":"日期时间工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/date-time-handling/distributed/datetime-best-practices"}]}]}